Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I don't like to be\Ninterrupted when I'm drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.74,0:01:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.69,0:01:31.95,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(976,825)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(524,0)\t(482,524,\1a&H00&)\c&H040404&\3c&H040404&\bord2.5\fscx135\fscy135}Whole Cake Island
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.69,0:01:31.95,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(976,825)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(524,0)\c&HFDFEFE&\fscx135\fscy135}Whole Cake Island
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give you a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.64,0:01:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is on his way to you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to scare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.84,0:01:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't, if you\Nkeep your hands off him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sit tight. I'll head to the land of\NWano and take care of that rat myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.62,0:01:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be screwing with me, hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sensitive. It's not about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a personal matter\Nto settle with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I don't take his head\Nmyself, then I'll lose face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beyond that, his crew took something\Nof mine and I want it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I recall, you owe me a bit of a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, don't tell me you\Nforgot. That was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe so but it's a lifelong debt
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grudge you have
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.51,0:02:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,against this Straw Hat kid I\Npromise you mine is greater
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.42,0:02:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one who kills that\Npunk if you test me, Lin Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you too. Try it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.30,0:02:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.78,0:02:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't call to ask for your opinion
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll lop his head off and be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.62,0:02:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be friends just\Nlike old times, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big mom is on the move seems\Nlike she's going to meet up
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.58,0:03:07.42,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,810)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(520,0)\t(478,520,\1a&H00&)\c&H040404&\3c&H040404&\bord2.5\fscx130\fscy130}New Marineford
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.58,0:03:07.42,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,810)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(520,0)\c&HFDFEFE&\fscx130\fscy130}New Marineford
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with Kaido I can't believe they're\Nusing an unsecured channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.82,0:03:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely they'd know we'd wiretapped\NThem, what's their angle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they trying to provoke us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.44,0:03:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be friends just\Nlike old times, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One emperor is enough trouble, but\Ntwo is just plain unmanageable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We would need an admiral or\Na couple warlords at least,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you want me to go\Ncheck it out, Sakazuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that would be a Mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't one who they've got\Nhighly skilled warriors there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The samurai.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.58,0:03:47.21,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,810)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(353,0)\t(311,353,\1a&H00&)\c&H040404&\3c&H040404&\bord2.5\fscx125\fscy125}The Red Port
Dialogue: 2,0:03:44.58,0:03:47.21,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,810)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(353,0)\c&HFDFEFE&\fscx125\fscy125}The Red Port
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caribou are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaido and big mom are\Nmeeting up and they're
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going after Straw Hat in\Nother words your grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't see\Nthe humor in this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your grandson aside, we can't allow\Ntwo of the four emperors to team up.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.26,0:04:07.14,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(525,0)\t(484,525,\1a&H00&)\fscx115\fscy115\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Vice Admiral Gion (Momousagi)\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 2,0:04:03.26,0:04:07.14,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(525,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx115\fscy115}Vice Admiral Gion (Momousagi)\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.96,0:04:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you expect us to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like it or not, the\Nreverie's going on right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.72,0:04:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All our marines are busy\Ntaking care of royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we just sit here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't no coincidence, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're talking about Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.90,0:04:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She knew Tang well we'd be\Nshort on soldiers, Otherwise,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.53,0:04:28.04,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(903,660)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(524,0)\t(483,524,\1a&H00&)\fscx115\fscy115\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Vice Admiral Tokikake (Chaton)\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.53,0:04:28.04,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(903,660)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(524,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx115\fscy115}Vice Admiral Tokikake (Chaton)\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.04,0:04:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I reckon she wouldn't have been\Nso bold about this whole business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure you're right, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what did the boss man have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said that the land of Wano\Nis a non-affiliated country,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.26,0:04:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's outside our jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better to mind her own business, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.32,0:04:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Big Mom and Kaido team up,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.27,0:04:53.40,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(932,715)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(520,0)\t(478,520,\1a&H00&)\fscx115\fscy115\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Rear Admiral Hina\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.27,0:04:53.40,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(932,715)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(520,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx115\fscy115}Rear Admiral Hina\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Navy will have some major\Nconsequences to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.34,0:04:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the reason you were\Nconsidered a Navy hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the Rocks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd be too young\Nto know about them, Hina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before Roger showed up,\Nit was their era for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that was 40 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The past is the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may have lost their captain,\Nbut they're not any weaker for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worries me a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.10,0:05:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the world's full of maybes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what makes it so fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grinning again, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. Enter King\NStella of Conney Kingdom
