Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it. The center of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now make your pledge, huh?\NCan I sit on the throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first i don't think it's\Nappropriate to joke about
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.86,0:06:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such a thing no man king\Nor otherwise may rest
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.94,0:06:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,upon that seat huh it's\Ncalled the empty throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for all nations of the\Nworld are on equal standing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and all rulers must pledge to\Nrespect each other's sovereignty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weapons that you see here laid\Nbefore the throne were placed there 800
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,years ago to represent an oath made by\Nthe first 20 who formed the modern world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.02,0:06:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This spot lies at the\Nvery center of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.94,0:06:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the fact that none sit upon\Nthe throne is a symbol of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.88,0:07:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The greatest authority in the\Ngovernment is held by the five elders,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who are the highest ranking\Namong the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, even amongst them,\Nthat power is divided.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is none who would be\Ncalled King of the World.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, King Stella, it's\Ntime to make your pledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.68,0:07:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I sit on that chair, I'll\Nbe the boss of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.04,0:07:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.98,0:07:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me sit there!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.85,0:07:34.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(268,276)\t(227,268,\1a&H00&)\t(2104,2145,\1a&HFF&)\fscx115\fscy115\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}{The Courtyard Party\NPangaea Castle}Unity Courtyard\NPangaea Castle
Dialogue: 2,0:07:31.85,0:07:34.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(268,276)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx115\fscy115}{The Courtyard Party\NPangaea Castle}Unity Courtyard\NPangaea Castle
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got one, I got one!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.24,0:07:49.24,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(517,0)\t(475,517,\1a&H00&)\fscx115\fscy115\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Saint Charlos\NWorld Noble (Celestial Dragon)
Dialogue: 2,0:07:45.24,0:07:49.24,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(517,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx115\fscy115}Saint Charlos\NWorld Noble (Celestial Dragon)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big, big mermaid, and she's\Nall mine now! Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not stopping him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot abide by this no\Nmatter the circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough wiggling, Miss Fishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get those chains off! Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let her go! Careful! Stay back, princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.32,0:08:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll get yourself killed that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.38,0:08:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's a celestial dragon! You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I care about that? Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Common sense doesn't apply to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll burn down every last inch\Nof Dressrosa if you make them mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that big jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Leo! Shirahoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop making this hard on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lay it cool, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Slave Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone will be so jealous\Nwhen they see my cute new pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand by and watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you do this\Nto Luffy Land's friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leo! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, I guess this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'm coming for\Nyou, Mermaid Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone stop that guy from Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.76,0:09:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you, creeps?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.82,0:09:53.70,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(982,665)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(520,0)\t(478,520,\1a&H00&)\fscx125\fscy125\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Rob Lucci\NCipher Pol 0
Dialogue: 2,0:09:49.82,0:09:53.70,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(982,665)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(520,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx125\fscy125}Rob Lucci\NCipher Pol 0
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think some gratitude\Nis in order first. Kaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for both zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't stopped your little outburst,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.10,0:10:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,several countries might\Nhave met their end.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.12,0:10:03.62,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,820)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(521,267)\t(479,521,\1a&H00&)\t(4233,4274,\1a&HFF&)\c&H040404&\3c&H040404&\bord2.5\fscx135\fscy135}Kaku
Dialogue: 2,0:09:59.12,0:10:03.62,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,820)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(521,267)\c&HFDFEFE&\fscx135\fscy135}Kaku
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stand against the Celestial\NDragons. Even a kid knows that much.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.58,0:10:08.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,820)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(400,0)\t(359,400,\1a&H00&)\c&H040404&\3c&H040404&\bord2.5\fscx135\fscy135}Stussy
Dialogue: 2,0:10:05.58,0:10:08.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,820)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(400,0)\c&HFDFEFE&\fscx135\fscy135}Stussy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol is a secret\Norganization under the world
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,government specializing in\Nintelligence and assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aegis Zero is its most powerful\Nunit under the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cy! I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.30,0:10:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The celestial dragons descended from\Nthe gods who created this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Royalty or not, you exist\Nin a realm beneath them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a god desires something of\Nyours, it must be granted to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, one of you morons gets it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call this justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.52,0:10:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A god is not required to make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.72,0:10:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otohime, this can't be the\Nworld you've dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where we would live under\Nthe same sun as humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know this isn't\Nright, make him stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, princess of Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.58,0:11:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't forget your kindness,\Nbrief as our friendship was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm sorry that you\Nhave to witness this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll split their skulls and return\Nto the bottom of the sea for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.58,0:11:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel, but you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is what life is like on the\Nsurface, the dream was dead from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loki, Neptune! You can't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let the worst examples\Nof mankind speak for all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:11:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll face the humans together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And maybe then, we can finally\Nmake a difference for the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.72,0:12:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For our children!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.86,0:12:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it's just a small one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we bare our hearts\Nto them, humans won't change!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must save Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You defy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol, kill him now! Good! Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, King Neptune, listen to reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Father, please don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.92,0:12:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't give in to hatred!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone hit a celestial\Ndragon! Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.68,0:12:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to do with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:12:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.98,0:13:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a fellow celestial dragon,\NI'm ashamed to see such behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a world noble, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.78,0:13:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of the princess, you dolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.32,0:13:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fool brought savagery\Nto your peaceful event.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.90,0:13:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you look surprised, I assume\Nyou don't remember me, Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I owe the Ryugu kingdom a great debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have been awaiting\Nthis day for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.14,0:13:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day that you would come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.36,0:13:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a foolish celestial dragon who drifted\Ndown to the Ryugu kingdom a decade ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lost and injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to save my life, filthy fools!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.53,0:14:07.28,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(518,0)\t(476,518,\1a&H00&)\fscx125\fscy125\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Saint Donquixote Mjosgard\NWorld Noble (Celestial Dragon)
Dialogue: 2,0:13:59.53,0:14:07.28,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(518,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx125\fscy125}Saint Donquixote Mjosgard\NWorld Noble (Celestial Dragon)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.62,0:14:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the eloquent words of the\Nlate queen that gave me my humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.10,0:14:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now I will do anything\Nin my power to aid you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Neptune, it is my honor\Nto welcome you to Mariejoie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Cipher Pol!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Retreat from here!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.30,0:14:28.68,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(356,521)\t(315,356,\1a&H00&)\t(2859,2901,\1a&HFF&)\fscx125\fscy125\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}The Holy Land{, }\NMary Geoise
Dialogue: 2,0:14:25.30,0:14:28.68,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(356,521)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx125\fscy125}The Holy Land{, }\NMary Geoise
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.76,0:14:32.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(997,820)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(400,0)\t(358,400,\1a&H00&)\c&H040404&\3c&H040404&\bord2.5\fscx125\fscy125}Pangaea Castle
Dialogue: 2,0:14:28.76,0:14:32.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(997,820)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(400,0)\c&HFDFEFE&\fscx125\fscy125}Pangaea Castle
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.23,0:14:40.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,810)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(521,518)\t(479,521,\1a&H00&)\t(3482,3524,\1a&HFF&)\c&H040404&\3c&H040404&\bord2.5\fscx125\fscy125}The Room of Authority
Dialogue: 2,0:14:36.23,0:14:40.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,810)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(521,518)\c&HFDFEFE&\fscx125\fscy125}The Room of Authority
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.20,0:14:47.07,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(516,0)\t(474,516,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}The Five Elders\NSupreme Council of the World Government
Dialogue: 2,0:14:43.20,0:14:47.07,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(516,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx110\fscy110}The Five Elders\NSupreme Council of the World Government
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've traveled quite a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.52,0:14:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be important; it's the\Nreverie now, considering your status.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:14:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should think you'd have the\Nsense to stay out of politics,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.68,0:15:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we're willing to honor\Nyour request this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, would you\Nexcuse us for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to speak to you\Nabout a certain pirate.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.33,0:15:39.33,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,810)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(1021,0)\t(979,1021,\1a&H00&)\c&H040404&\3c&H040404&\bord2.5\fscx125\fscy125}Unity Courtyard, Pangaea Castle
Dialogue: 2,0:15:34.33,0:15:39.33,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,810)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(1021,0)\c&HFDFEFE&\fscx125\fscy125}Unity Courtyard, Pangaea Castle
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised at how few people are left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hardly a surprise\Nafter something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.46,0:15:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt anyone wants to get tangled\Nup in unwanted trouble, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.78,0:15:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the bruises have\Ncompletely disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Manchili.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was just like magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The biggest and the smallest princesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite a spectacle\Nto see you two together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I was afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.76,0:16:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was awfully rude of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.68,0:16:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Mom Cherie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to beat yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.84,0:16:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Realistically speaking, all countries\Nhave both good and bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.78,0:16:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We fishmen are no exception\Nto that rule either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude, Myoscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I could\Nkeep my promise to Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.70,0:16:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, Neptune, consider this\Npayment for saving me long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.98,0:16:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During the seven-day conference, I\Npromised to look after Princess Shirahoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.60,0:16:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm thankful my status is\Nfinally helping someone for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then I can kick the Celestial Dragon's\Nbutts and say that it was in order?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was told I was supposed to\Nkeep my hands off of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.10,0:17:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you give me permission...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will gladly take\Nresponsibility for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, do what you must\Nto protect the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.42,0:17:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now ain't that something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe one\Nof them's got a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.74,0:17:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My most sincere apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.78,0:17:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that there was some trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I should have never left your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.94,0:17:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, how's my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.80,0:17:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Cobra's occupied at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's with Fujitora, that one\Nadmiral who sent the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants to speak to King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.26,0:17:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's give them time.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.51,0:17:51.97,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,810)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(516,0)\t(475,516,\1a&H00&)\c&H040404&\3c&H040404&\bord2.5\fscx125\fscy125}Pangaea Castle
Dialogue: 2,0:17:48.51,0:17:51.97,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,810)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(516,0)\c&HFDFEFE&\fscx125\fscy125}Pangaea Castle
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pangaea Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has three entryways outside of its main\Ngate, all of which are heavily guarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of those gates belongs\Nto the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.74,0:18:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It leads to the Land of the Gods.\NThis is where these nobles reside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.98,0:18:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! State your name!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.70,0:18:21.71,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(522,0)\t(480,522,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Queen Dowager Conney\NKingdom of Sorbet
Dialogue: 2,0:18:17.70,0:18:21.71,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(522,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx110\fscy110}Queen Dowager Conney\NKingdom of Sorbet
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wyatt's Queen Dowager Nami\Nof the Sorbet Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.10,0:18:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The land of the gods\Nlies beyond this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.76,0:18:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that it's far too\Ndangerous for you to proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.90,0:18:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, return to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that, dear Scott!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,St.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.19,0:18:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charles, please calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll open your wounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.10,0:18:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man will pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my word!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, open the gate! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.74,0:18:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.64,0:18:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,St.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.55,0:18:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charles is injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs medical assistance\Nimmediately! Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.24,0:19:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it! To the doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness, Jarnos!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.60,0:19:25.39,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(519,0)\t(479,519,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Saint Rosward\NWorld Noble (Celestial Dragon)
Dialogue: 2,0:19:21.60,0:19:25.39,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,715)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(519,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx110\fscy110}Saint Rosward\NWorld Noble (Celestial Dragon)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you faring after\Nyour recent incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my poor boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I heard the news,\NI rushed over to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Roswell, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.26,0:19:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my beloved son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.39,0:19:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the Queen Dowager?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.52,0:19:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That blasted don't kill\Nthem, yes God must pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.02,0:19:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:20:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of celestial dragon\Nrefuses to keep even a single slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.84,0:20:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just like that kook Aokiji who\Ndescended to the lower world 30 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.90,0:20:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Don Quixote family has some nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.32,0:20:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That big bunch of lunatics.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't realize,\NFather, you brought him?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.48,0:20:20.53,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,660)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(525,0)\t(484,525,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Warlord Bartholomew Kuma\N(Former Revolutionary Officer)\N(Former King of Sorbet)
Dialogue: 2,0:20:14.48,0:20:20.53,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,660)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(525,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx110\fscy110}Warlord Bartholomew Kuma\N(Former Revolutionary Officer)\N(Former King of Sorbet)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.16,0:20:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Invincible Slave, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.66,0:20:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was finally my long-awaited turn to\Ntake him for a spin on the rental list.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The invincible slave makes\Na fine steed, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wait was surely worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.82,0:20:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knew a warlord would make such\Na fine mode of transportation?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.34,0:20:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's so much fun to hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can stab him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't scream, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.42,0:20:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's truly the finest slave of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's glorious, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.30,0:20:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.38,0:20:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.26,0:20:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't die first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.22,0:21:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.64,0:21:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.44,0:21:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.35,0:21:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've really had a rotten\Ntime since everyone got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my poor Chalus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's summon the world's greatest\Ndoctor to fix you up, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to run into\Nhim out in the open like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.81,0:21:32.06,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,660)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(516,0)\t(474,516,\1a&H00&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}Captain Jewelry Bonney\NBonney Pirates\NA Pirate of the Worst Generation
Dialogue: 2,0:21:24.81,0:21:32.06,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,660)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(516,0)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx110\fscy110}Captain Jewelry Bonney\NBonney Pirates\NA Pirate of the Worst Generation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.54,0:21:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I made it inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure they all pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.68,0:21:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.29,0:21:58.30,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,795)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(522,0)\t(480,522,\1a&H00&)\c&H040404&\3c&H040404&\bord2.5}Beneath the Land of the Gods, Home of the Celestial Dragons
Dialogue: 2,0:21:52.29,0:21:58.30,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,796)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(522,0)\c&HFDFEFE&}Beneath the Land of the Gods, Home of the Celestial Dragons
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool your jets, Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.86,0:21:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golly, you boys can be so scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:22:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,scary you're telling\Nme you're not angry you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.32,0:22:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,saw what those monsters\Nare doing to our comrade
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.12,0:22:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're torturing that\Npoor kind-hearted man
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.54,0:22:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll pay for this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.36,0:22:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,calm down we feel you it really is\Nterrible i promise that we won't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.84,0:22:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leave kuma in that state after\Nall that's the reason we're here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is, even if we free him, I'm\Nafraid he won't return to his former self
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.58,0:22:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma was a victim of the world\Ngovernment's oppression in one
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.24,0:22:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way or another They made an example\Nout of him It was a warning, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's safe from us, even\Nkings of allied nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who defy the gods will all be\Nbrought to their knees without question?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.14,0:22:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have the whole Navy and CP0 on\Ntheir side, more than anyone can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.48,0:22:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't screw up and get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.40,0:23:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.52,0:23:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.70,0:23:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either we succeed, or die.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.83,0:23:17.29,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,770)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(520,0)\t(479,520,\1a&H00&)\c&H040404&\3c&H040404&\bord2.5\fscx125\fscy125}The Holy Land, Mary Geoise
