Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.34,0:23:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The World Government is\Na massive organization
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.22,0:23:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,encompassing most of the world's nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.12,0:23:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,170 in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.90,0:23:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every four years,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.54,0:23:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,50 Chosen Rulers are\Nsent to this Holy Land to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.08,0:23:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,represent their nations\Nin important negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.48,0:23:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one is my seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.30,0:24:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last. Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.88,0:24:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how's your country been?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.22,0:24:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said pirates left it\Nin ruin four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.58,0:24:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're locked up and in Pell-Daho,\Ncourtesy of Fleet Admiral Sakazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.88,0:24:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which reminds me, who is this boy I keep\Nhearing about in the news? You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.22,0:24:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Straw Hat Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.42,0:24:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made an attempt on Big Mom's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.98,0:24:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's rumored that he has\Nhis sights set on Kaido next.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.18,0:24:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fancy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.09,0:24:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.50,0:24:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I wonder what's going to\Nhappen in the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.82,0:24:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't participate in the world\Ngovernment, so needless to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.32,0:24:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's practically a lawless land.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.58,0:24:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, I must raise the\Nquestion, can we even consider them a nation?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.54,0:24:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should make\Nthat our business, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.94,0:24:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hardly that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.16,0:24:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The navy costs money.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.22,0:25:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trouble seems to follow that Straw Hat\NLuffy wherever he goes, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.70,0:25:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sounds like a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.58,0:25:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.10,0:25:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so funny, Prudence?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.42,0:25:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.72,0:25:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As always, we have a new chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.26,0:25:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.72,0:25:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.26,0:25:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.58,0:25:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Bollywood, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.16,0:25:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.92,0:25:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.06,0:25:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll run this efficiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.30,0:25:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.58,0:25:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have quite a lot to address.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.16,0:25:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most influential rulers in all\Nfour seas begin their discussions.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.72,0:25:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together, they will reshape the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.62,0:25:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, without further ado,\Nlet's commence the debate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.02,0:25:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For seven days, my fellow noblemen, we\Nshall speak of this beautiful world of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.96,0:26:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Reverie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.62,0:26:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like the conference has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.82,0:26:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While on that subject,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.66,0:26:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cobra, the King of Alabasta, is\Nrequesting a special meeting with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.80,0:26:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Nefertari family, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.88,0:26:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.12,0:26:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were the only family\Nof the first twenty who
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.40,0:26:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stayed in the Lower World\Neight hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.44,0:26:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, in a sense, they're traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.12,0:26:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has he noticed something out of sorts?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.16,0:26:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope he doesn't\Novercomplicate things for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.98,0:26:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worrisome times, Big Mom\Nand Kaido are trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.44,0:26:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This started with the war of the best,\Nand now I fear it can't be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.44,0:26:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The balance of the world\Ncan't be maintained forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.76,0:26:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This we all know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.72,0:26:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that in mind, I believe the time has\Ncome for a great cleansing, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:58.60,0:27:03.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(518,520)\t(476,518,\1a&H00&)\t(4480,4522,\1a&HFF&)\fscx110\fscy110\c&H010405&\3c&H010405&\bord2.5}The Chamber of Flowers\NPangaea Castle
Dialogue: 2,0:26:58.60,0:27:03.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnKakumin Web\pos(960,710)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(518,520)\c&HFAFAFA&\fscx110\fscy110}The Chamber of Flowers\NPangaea Castle
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.62,0:27:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great emu, they have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.66,0:27:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.78,0:28:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you decided upon which light\Nis to be extinguished, great lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.52,0:28:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who will be cleansed from history?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.92,0:28:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak, lord, and share their name.

